    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c36890a9fab2107f",
      "translationZh": "大家好，我做了 whatmodel.sh",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89147d2c5402180f",
      "translationZh": "输入你的 RAM 和 GPU 信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ae534fbd6a81d47",
      "translationZh": "查看你能在本地运行哪些模型，以及它们的排名和运行命令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be215c1218d83026",
      "translationZh": "用同一套评分将它们与 API 模型进行比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4412bf6f91f9654a",
      "translationZh": "开发它的过程中，我意识到，一台 32GB 的 Mac 现在已经能完全在本地免费运行一个得分与 GPT-5 相当的模型了（例如 4-bit 的 Qwen3.8 27B）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c79a76ffa0cf2a62",
      "translationZh": "每个模型都有一个基于 19,731 条已发布的基准测试结果拟合得出的分数，而且每条结果都链接到其来源。评分方法见 whatmodel.sh/method，数据、评分代码和基准测试脚本均已开源：github.com/jakemanger/whatmodel",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7e0af5bb347bf8e",
      "translationZh": "它也能在终端中使用：curl whatmodel.sh",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb2f867fb3b9a4ee",
      "translationZh": "如果你想参与贡献，可以使用基准测试脚本收集实际使用中的 tok/s；你也可以在 github 上提交任何新模型及其基准测试分数，并附上来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6504d04048ac966c",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/jakecoolguy 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
